---
InheritParentConfig: true

# Test fixtures expose protected state to their TEST_F bodies.
# GoogleTest reports an exception escaping a test as a failure, and walking
# asio and OxCo call graphs makes exception-escape dominate analysis time.
Checks: >
  -cppcoreguidelines-non-private-member-variables-in-classes,
  -bugprone-exception-escape
...
